FORM CORR_MAINT_/S4P0/V_ENH_E01C USING VALUE(CM_ACTION) RC.
  DATA: RETCODE LIKE SY-SUBRC, COUNT TYPE I, TRSP_KEYLEN TYPE SYFLENG.
  FIELD-SYMBOLS: <TAB_KEY_X> TYPE X.
  CLEAR RC.
MOVE /S4P0/V_ENH_E01C-ENHANCEMENT TO
